  "claim": "The solicitor who won the show  Back to Reality ahead of Steven James Hewitt and Craig Phillips is English. The solicitor that was a chair of Global Witness is also English.",
  "evidencia": "Page: Mark Stephens (solicitor). Sentence: Mark Howard Stephens CBE (born 7 April 1957) is an English solicitor specialising in media law, intellectual property rights and human rights with the firm Howard Kennedy LLP.\nPage: James Hewitt. Sentence: James Lifford Hewitt (born 30 April 1958) is an English former cavalry officer in the British Army.\nPage: Global Witness. Sentence: Gillian Caldwell joined the organisation as Executive Director in July 2015 and Mark Stephens (solicitor) was appointed Chair in March 2016.\nPage: Back to Reality (TV series). Sentence: The show was presented by Tess Daly and Richard Bacon, the first and only series of the show finished with James Hewitt winning the show ahead of Maureen Rees and Craig Phillips.",
