        "original_id": "8939b16f-18a9-5292-b9fc-83621b7db7df",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Stephens, James Hewitt, Gillian Caldwell, Tess Daly, Richard Bacon, Maureen Rees, Craig Phillips\n- Organizations: Howard Kennedy LLP, Global Witness, British Army\n- Roles: solicitor, Executive Director, Chair, cavalry officer, presenters, winner\n- Topics: media law, intellectual property rights, human rights\n- Events: appointments at Global Witness, Back to Reality results\n- Products: Back to Reality\n\nFacts:\n- Mark Stephens was born on 7 April 1957.\n- James Hewitt was born on 30 April 1958.\n- Mark Stephens is an English solicitor with Howard Kennedy LLP who specialises in media law, intellectual property rights, and human rights.\n- James Hewitt is an English former cavalry officer in the British Army.\n- Gillian Caldwell joined Global Witness as Executive Director in July 2015.\n- Mark Stephens was appointed Chair of Global Witness in March 2016.\n- Back to Reality was presented by Tess Daly and Richard Bacon.\n- The first and only series of Back to Reality ended with James Hewitt winning ahead of Maureen Rees and Craig Phillips.",
